  "markdown": "# Repo-map retrieval evaluation\n\n- Root: `/applications/data/projects/bigville`\n- Tasks: 8 (`/home/matt/ozmadev/ozagia/evaluation/bigville_retrieval/tasks.json`)\n- Source-file universe: 501\n- Budgets: 300, 700, 1300 tokens\n- Arms: dev_context\n- Dev-memory snapshot: stale=False (snapshot head `e243ea70eee2a9ca5a55dfe62b9e29214f82cc87`, HEAD `e243ea70eee2a9ca5a55dfe62b9e29214f82cc87`, root mismatch False, allow_stale=False)\n- Deterministic fingerprint: `914aa23543babd258df7139255b06e67febaaa26de5ceeb886863c6927974817`\n- Wall time: 9.887 s\n\n## Aggregate metrics\n\n| Budget | Arm | Tasks | Mean recall@budget | Mean recall (content tier) | Mean precision | Mean evidence coverage | Mean evidence symbols | Mean evidence/1k tokens | Mean files | Mean content files | Mean tokens | Mean s | Cache parsed | Cache reused |\n|---:|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| 300 | dev_context | 8 | 0.125 | 0.125 | 0.073 | 0.295 | 0.0 | 45.28 | 2.2 | 2.2 | 253 | 0.41 | 0 | 0 |\n| 700 | dev_context | 8 | 0.188 | 0.188 | 0.081 | 0.384 | 0.0 | 30.77 | 3.9 | 3.9 | 614 | 0.39 | 0 | 0 |\n| 1300 | dev_context | 8 | 0.062 | 0.062 | 0.021 | 0.435 | 0.0 | 22.75 | 4.8 | 4.8 | 1003 | 0.38 | 0 | 0 |\n\n## Recall by task\n\nEach cell is `recall (recall_content)`.\n\n### 300 tokens\n\n| Task | dev_context |\n|---|---:|\n| game-checkpoint-roundtrip | 0.00 (0.00) |\n| deterministic-population-report | 0.00 (0.00) |\n| lazy-affordance-mode | 0.00 (0.00) |\n| tick-graph-resource-conflicts | 0.00 (0.00) |\n| seed-manifest-recovery | 0.50 (0.50) |\n| backend-action-boundary | 0.00 (0.00) |\n| scenario-input-validation | 0.50 (0.50) |\n| public-game-construction | 0.00 (0.00) |\n\n### 700 tokens\n\n| Task | dev_context |\n|---|---:|\n| game-checkpoint-roundtrip | 0.00 (0.00) |\n| deterministic-population-report | 0.50 (0.50) |\n| lazy-affordance-mode | 0.00 (0.00) |\n| tick-graph-resource-conflicts | 0.00 (0.00) |\n| seed-manifest-recovery | 0.50 (0